if the value cannot be loaded from the .go file and the makefile
create new .env file by running 

=> 1. echo "password = dsadasd" > .env 
   2. change the file owner from root => your project user (hwan)


Shut down the 8080 project

=> 1. lsof -ti :8080
   2. kill -9 78234


app.log server

=> 1. add => && stdbuf -oL ./$(APP_NAME) => change Line-buffered
   2. make reload
   3. tail -f /home/backend/app.log 


------------------------------------------------------------------------------

psql 

1. CREATE USER test WITH PASSWORD '1234'; => user
2. CREATE DATABASE mydb OWNER test; => mydb
3. GRANT ALL PRIVILEGES ON DATABASE mydb TO test; => read , write , update 

=> psql -U test -d mydb -h localhost

migration.load file

=> this code is a configuartion that migrates data 
from SQLite demo.db to PostgreSQL mydb automaically creates tables and indexes, 
applies memory optimizations, 
and converts boolean and text data types to fit 
the PostgresSQL environment.


